module Core

### Represents the protocol for in-place exponentiation.
### `InPlaceExponentiable` is for mutable numeric values that update themselves
### with a power result instead of returning a separate value.
protocol InPlaceExponentiable
  ### Raises this value by `you` in place.
  ### :param you: The exponent value.
  ### :note: The right-hand operand should remain unchanged.
  @writable
  routine Me.$ipow(you: Me)
